1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,500
Institutional DeFi desks hit EVM block gas
limits under cold-storage clearing.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Multilateral debt netting & batch auctions
quickly saturate standard EVM execution.

3
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:17,500
StylusClear v0.8.0 solves this in no_std
Rust compiled for Arbitrum Stylus.

4
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Zero-patch WASM 1.0 MVP: 24,527 B Brotli-q11
(below 24 KB legacy & 96 KB ArbOS 61 caps).

5
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:30,600
Zero floating-point or post-MVP opcodes,
verified via Binaryen wasm-opt --mvp-features.

6
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:37,500
Scenario 1 clears a 4-desk institutional ring:
$13,200 gross compressed to $1,050 residual.

7
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:44,500
92.05% settlement liquidity saved across 2
multilateral cycles + 2.00 WETH @ $2,850.

8
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:51,500
Scaling the canonical 2-Origin BFS mesh to
24 and 64 desks runs in under 5 milliseconds.

9
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:58,500
Scenario 2 triggers our fail-closed oracle
band guard: LimitPriceViolated.

10
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:05,500
The entire batch rolls back atomically with
0.00% compression and zero partial state.

11
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:13,500
Scenario 4: Robinhood Chain Testnet (46630)
clearing USDG + tokenized equity NVDAx.

12
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:22,000
$24,000 gross obligations compressed to
$1,400 residual — 94.17% liquidity saved.

13
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,500
Adaptive floor-capped liquidation protects
borrowers and guarantees vault solvency.

14
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:37,000
Dual-chain ready: Arbitrum Sepolia (421614)
and Robinhood Chain Testnet (46630).

15
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Payable StylusAtomicFactory binds CREATE2
salt to caller + admin to stop front-running.

16
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Detects 0xEFF000 Stylus bytecode, activates
via ArbWasm (0x71), and initializes atomically.

17
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Strict ERC-20 balance-delta checks guard
every deposit, withdraw, and debt repayment.

18
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Stylus storage cache flushes before every
external contract call for state safety.

19
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Keyless eth_call dual-VM parity verification
works directly from workbench or CLI.

20
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:26,500
Inspect live on-chain settlement receipts
and verified contracts on the block explorer.

21
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:35,000
Strictly isomorphic benchmarks: 2, 9, 33, 45
eliminated cycles on both Foundry & Rust.

22
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:43,500
Stress tier drops from 18.29M cold EVM gas
to 1.97M Stylus gas: -89.2% (9.26x savings).

23
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:51,000
Comfortably below Arbitrum's 32M single-block
gas cap under EIP-2929 vm.cool() cold slots.

24
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:59,500
6/6 Z3 SMT theorems PROVED_UNSAT + 100/100
matched-auction Hypothesis fuzz runs.

25
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:06,500
Cross-checked against clearing-cli + 15/15
Foundry, 8/8 Cargo, and 5/5 Pytest gates.

26
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:12,600
StylusClear v0.8.0 — reproducible verification
in under 20 seconds via verify-judge-60s.sh.
